        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-CPMTOMIE-ANKH-SYMB.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-CPMTOMIE-SYMB-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH536-RECURSION-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH537-BRANCH-DETERM-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH538-TOKEN-TPUT-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH539-SYMB-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH540-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-CPMTOMIE-SYMB-WIT   PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SYMBOLIC.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-SYMBOLIC.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH536-RECURSION-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH537-BRANCH-DETERM-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH538-TOKEN-TPUT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH539-SYMB-SAAT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH540-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-FPGA-CPMTOMIE-SYMB-WIT
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-FPGA-CPMTOMIE-SYMB-WIT.
